<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[夜里守烘炉 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Daily 9]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<link [[闭馆后的旧档 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Date 4]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
